MTD	mzTab-version	2.1.0-M
MTD	mzTab-ID	ST001610_AN002644
MTD	mzTab-profile	M+S
MTD	title	Control (DMSO 0.1%; v/v) and 10 µM DRB18 treated A549 lung cancer cells in vitro for 48 hours
MTD	description	Control (DMSO 0.1%; v/v) and 10 µM DRB18 were used to treated 5 million A549 lung cancer cells in vitro for 48 hours. The untargeted metabolomics analysis was performed on the cell lysates. The main objective of the study was to determine changes in metabolite abundances in lung cancer after treatment with DRB18, an inhibitor of glucose transporter proteins.
